WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Ṱanganyisani mavu a nṱha a bvaho fhethu hunzhi kha ndima. Bvisani matombo, midzi na maṱari.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Ḓadzani tshipiḓa tshithihi tsha zwiraru tsha khali nga mavu. Engedzani maḓi na sopho ya u ṱanzwa ndilo. Valani, ni zunguze ni vhee fhasi.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Nga murahu ha munithi muthihi, muṱavha wo dzika fhasi. Swayani nṱha ha tshiṱaṱo tshawo.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Nga murahu ha awara mbili, swayani nṱha ha tshiṱaṱo tshi tevhelaho. Ndi matope.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Ṱolani nga murahu ha ḓuvha ḽithihi kana mavhili. Musi maḓi o no vhonalela, swayani tshiṱaṱo tsha vumba. Zwoṱhe zwi ṱahaho ndi organic matter.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Vhambedzani vhulapfu ha tshiṱaṱo tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe na vhulapfu hoṱhe ha mavu o dzikaho khalini.
